
This directory mostly manages strings and resources in Vivaldi

android: Android Vivaldi specific strings and resources

ios: IOS Vivaldi specific strings and resources

native_resources: ALL strings and resources added by Vivaldi goes here (!!DO NOT!! add them in resources/)

other_resource: Windows specific logos and files. See README file

resources: Overrides of existing Chromium strings to handle strings that does not fit well with Vivaldi,
           or does not auto search/replace correctly, and additional translations for CHromium strings.
           !!DO NOT!! add new strings and resources from Vivaldi here.

version_assembly: Vivaldi override templates for Chromium exectuable target manifests
